  "Guest-side defensibility test: demonstrate whether a guest CAN detect or reject a deterministic host source (theory_skeptic's untested assumption — if guests can defend, the 'un-defendable' arm weakens)",
  "Positioning against practitioner find-fix set: the contribution must explicitly frame itself as synthesis/characterization AGAINST CrowdSec PR#4495, wetware issue#106, wapc/wapc-go, and wazero issue#620, not as discovery"
]

